# Pen templates (authored content IR)

Pen is the universal **authored-content** language for par Noir (humans, collaborators, AI agents). Social/browser artifacts are **Notes** (and related compile targets), not a separate Thought kingdom. Full product plan: living Pen ADR / build plan when present.

## Template-first (hard process rule)

When building any new pN surface for **authored or publishable content** (posts, notes, collections, feeds, later sites/communities):

1. **Assign a Pen class (form)** under a category (`classId` in `@par-noir/pen-protocol`), then **define and register the template**.
2. **Then** build UI (Pen, Pen Mini, browse, L5) as a thin renderer/compiler of that template.
3. Do **not** invent a parallel content model, storage layout, or one-off “special case” blob format beside Pen.

Hierarchy: **Category → Form → Template** (e.g. Social → Notes → Basic Note). Template `classId` is always a form, never a category.

Structured/relational personal data (sheets, standard data points) may be additional template families on the same spine — not a second custody story. Kit-only **Records** uses `audience: 'kit'` (hidden from Pen New…).

## First-party vs community

- **First-party:** build only what scales the pN ecosystem.
- **Starter pack (platform-owned, consumer):** peer categories —
  - **Social** — Notes, Posts, Collections, **Sets** (refs to other docs; compile later), Feeds (entitlement: self-hosted)
  - **Projects** — Journal, List, Letter, Note (correspondence shapes; DM delivery later)
- **Library** — Book, Article (durable **authoring** category; Project publish may save as Library template or create finished Library doc — not a subclass of Projects)
- **Time** — Calendar, Event, Schedule
- **Kit-only:** **Records** — Register (`audience: 'kit'`; L5/API catalog, not end-user New…)
- **Personal templates:** local “Yours” in New… (Publish → As template; Projects may also Publish → As Library template). Not the community marketplace.
- **Community:** open template building **after** IR, compile contract, and permissions are stable. Do not ship a template marketplace before the spine.

## Editing UX (when implementing Pen / Pen Mini)

- **Flow-first** left pane: TipTap continuous text for the **active text layer**; section switcher = current section ▾ TOC; FormatRibbon scoped over the editor only. Image/video embeds use `wrap: none|left|right` in the flow; **Attach → From Pen** inserts live by-ref `penEmbed` nodes (`docId` + optional `sectionSlug`) — not overlay layers. Do not put article embeds in `PenPageLayer`.
- **Social live preview:** browse **feed tile** (full-bleed `pagePresentation` + right engagement rail), not a Docs card.
- **Editable page** right pane (non-social): `LayoutSurface` for **overlay** text/image layers only (absolute % rects; move/resize)—not HTML-only preview, not dashboard tiles.
- **Quark-like** = templates + page layer overlay surface (Product C). Home **Dashboard** is a separate packed grid (Product A: col/row swap), not `LayoutSurface`.
- New document picker: category drill-down, optional pin/show-all, catalog search, **Yours** personal templates (consumer classes only).
- Home: **My Library** — **All** | **Category** | **Dashboard** (plain text; active bold); **+** / **−** (bulk select delete, same idea as dashboard storage / browse upload); list/gallery icon toggle; notebook explorer (blue row rules, red double margin).

## Storage / collab invariants

- Per-user cloud replica under `par-noir-pen/{docId}/` (same idea as group messaging materialization).
- Section versioning = fixed current filename; supersede moves to `past/` with **date in the title**.
- Updates use messaging-style **outbox** fanout — do not invent a second sync bus.
- No shared single Drive folder as multi-writer SoT.

## Naming

| Term | Use |
|---|---|
| Pen | App / builder / protocol |
| Pen Mini | Browse miniature composer |
| Note / Notes | Feed/social `contentClass` (replaces Thought); also Projects form `projects.note` for correspondence |
| Collection | Ordered slide/story form (`collection.*` templates; browse `contentClass: 'collection'`) |
| Set | Social form that references other docs (`social.set`) |
| Projects | Active WIP category (journal, list, letter, note) |
| Library | Durable authoring category (Book, Article); finished Project work may land here as a doc or as a Library template |
| Time | Calendar / scheduling category |
| Records | Kit-only structured registers |

Do not reintroduce Thought as product vocabulary for new work. Hard-cut legacy thought paths when touching that code (dev-only; no compat shims). Do not use “carousel” as product vocabulary for new Pen work. Do not use “bundle” for Sets.

## Package

Shared logic lives in `@par-noir/pen-protocol` (when the package exists). Apps only wire unlock, Drive I/O via `ownerFetch`, and UI.
